<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Pepkor, Waltons cautions on talks.</title>
<headline>Pepkor, Waltons cautions on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pepkor Ltd, Waltons Stationary Co Ltd and Waltons Consolidated Investment Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that discussions were taking place, which if successfully concluded, could have an effect on the share prices of the three firms.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>	  -- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
